=head1 NAME

XML::Simple - An API for simple XML files

=head1 SYNOPSIS

PLEASE DO NOT USE THIS MODULE IN NEW CODE.  If you ignore this
warning and use it anyway, the C<qw(:strict)> mode will save you a little pain.

    use XML::Simple qw(:strict);

